    "description": "Two photographs taken at the same monument in 2000 and 2022 are used to investigate changes in the river’s water level. The site is reconstructed in Blender using a digital elevation model (DEM), with cameras positioned to approximate the original viewpoints. Visible water edges are then compared against the reconstructed terrain to estimate the water level in each photograph.",
